What value does `result` hold after the code below runs?
```c
#include <stdio.h>

int max(int a, int b)
{
    if (a > b) return a;
    else       return b;
}

int main(void)
{
    int result = max(3, 9) + max(7, 2);
    printf("%d\n", result);
    return 0;
}
```

